11. TLA+ SKELETON

```tla
------------------------- MODULE STT1024_A2_Actions --------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets, Sequences

CONSTANTS
    S,           \* State space (A4)
    SPL,         \* Predicate set (A5)
    Invariants,  \* Invariant set ⊆ SPL
    C_max,       \* Max action cycle cost
    N_A,         \* Max library size
    K_pre,       \* Max preconditions per action
    K_env,       \* Max envelope predicates per action

ActionType == {"ACTUATE", "COMMUNICATE", "COMPUTE", "REQUEST_HUMAN"}

Action == [
    id           : STRING,
    type         : ActionType,
    preconditions: Seq(SPL),
    effect       : S -> S,
    envelope     : Seq(SPL),
    cost_cycles  : 0..C_max,
    cost_energy  : Nat,
    signature    : STRING,
    version      : STRING
]

\* The action library.
A == { a \in Action : SchemaWellFormed(a) }

\* Schema well-formedness checks.
SchemaWellFormed(a) ==
    /\ Len(a.preconditions) <= K_pre
    /\ Len(a.envelope) <= K_env
    /\ a.cost_cycles <= C_max
    /\ \A p \in a.preconditions : p \in SPL
    /\ \A e \in a.envelope : e \in SPL
    /\ \A s \in S : a.effect[s] \in S   \* totality on precondition domain

\* Committability, mirroring A5 §4.2.
Committable(s, a) ==
    LET pre_ok == \A p \in a.preconditions : eval(p, s)
        env_ok == \A e \in a.envelope : eval(e, s)
        s_next == a.effect[s]
        inv_ok == \A i \in Invariants : eval(i, s_next)
    IN pre_ok /\ env_ok /\ inv_ok

\* Commit applies the effect.
Commit(s, a) == a.effect[s]

\* A2 finiteness theorem.
THEOREM Finiteness == IsFiniteSet(A)

\* A2 determinism theorem.
THEOREM EffectDeterminism ==
    \A a \in A, s1, s2 \in S :
        s1 = s2 => a.effect[s1] = a.effect[s2]

\* A2 committability theorem.
THEOREM CommittabilityDecidable ==
    \A s \in S, a \in A :
        \E v \in BOOLEAN : v <=> Committable(s, a)

=============================================================================
```

The theorems Finiteness, EffectDeterminism, and CommittabilityDecidable are the A2 obligations. Each requires model-checking for specific instances and proof-assistant discharge for the general case.

